'''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth III''' is an [[NPC]] that is found in the {{Zone|Museum}}. She can be clicked to open the Museum menu. Once the player has reached Museum Milestone 3, she will also appraise their museum for a one-time fee of {{c|10M}}.

