== Appraisal ==
Once the player has reached Museum Milestone 3 and paid '''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth III''' {{C|10m|short=y}}, she will display the total value of the player's museum.

== Trivia ==
*'''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth III''' calculates the value of the player's [[Garden]] with the following equation:
*:<math>\text{Value} = \text{GardenLevel} \times 10,000,000 + 100</math>.
* '''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth III''' used to have an {{item|Abiphone}} contact, unlocked from [[Museum Milestones]]. However, this feature was swiftly and silently removed.

